  "outstanding": [
    "The large-gap coefficient estimate, the bounded branching translate and the eigenvector lower bound are developed in LKC-01/03, CTI-01/02 and BPP-01/03. The transverse integral then combines these estimates with the separate stabilizer-volume bound.",
    "The formal-degree small-neighbourhood inequality and the simultaneous derivative estimate are located in the primary sources. The derivative estimate only increases the common loss used by the package.",
    "The adelic product decomposition and positivity and finiteness of the congruence-preimage volume enter TPD-03. The lattice counting, cusp-form bounds and choice of depth are separate steps in the proof of nonvanishing."
  ]
}
